        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 26858 Oval Plate Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia classic 858 lever with Oval plates is for residential and commercial use. Built to withstand heavy use, it is UL listed and fire rated. The mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design. The Oval backplates feature a unique inside-to-outside mounting with screwless outside plates.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/oval-plates-with-wave-lever-entry-lockset-omnia-d26858\">Omnia D26858</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEach set contains door levers, backplates, mortise latchset, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 26858 Mortise Set\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Oval Backplate Height 10-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (Contact us if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\"or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate for all lock bodies, finished to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard \"C\" keyway supplied with two nickel silver keys.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions & Specs (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> Stationary both sides of door. Fixed levers, non-functioning. Used as door pulls or to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall / Closet):</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bathroom / Bedroom):</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side. Deadbolt by turnpiece inside and emergency key outside. Turning inside lever will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by lever inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Entry:</b>  Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by lever inside. Deadbolt activated only by key from either side. </li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. Turning inside lever will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever inside and btykey outside. The outside lever is rigid. Auxiliary latchbolt deadlocks latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Oval Plate Mortise Lockset, Omnia 26858",
                "description": "Omnia 26858 Mortise Lockset - Omnia classic 858 lever with Oval plates is for residential and commercial use. Built to withstand heavy use, it is UL listed and fire rated. The mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design. The Oval backplates feature a unique inside-to-outside mounting with screwless outside plates.\r\n\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-26858 Omnia 858 Lever Oval Plate Mortise Locksets, Omnia 26858 Mortise Locksets, omnia deadbolt, omnia commercial mortise deadbolts, omnia #858 levers, omnia 858 door levers,"
